  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 295604224
    m_Localized: SHARDS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296000
    m_Localized: Spare Battery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296001
    m_Localized: A fresh cell. Refills the torch and switches it on. Press {key}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763065
  - m_Id: 375296002
    m_Localized: Star Compass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296003
    m_Localized: Points at the nearest star for five seconds. Press {key}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763065
  - m_Id: 375296004
    m_Localized: Second Wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296005
    m_Localized: When it catches you, it lets go. Once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296006
    m_Localized: Long Fuse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296007
    m_Localized: Ten more seconds on the hatch timer, next floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296008
    m_Localized: Quiet Shoes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296009
    m_Localized: Your footsteps carry a third less, next floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296010
    m_Localized: Extra Lamps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296011
    m_Localized: More lamps lit on the next floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296012
    m_Localized: Stamina Tonic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296013
    m_Localized: Double sprint stamina (200%), next floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296014
    m_Localized: Torch Colour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296015
    m_Localized: Cold. Ember. Violet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296016
    m_Localized: HUD Tint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296017
    m_Localized: Phosphor. Amber. Ice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296018
    m_Localized: Bottle Pack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296019
    m_Localized: Start the next floor already carrying three bottles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296020
    m_Localized: Focus Lens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296021
    m_Localized: The focused beam reaches further, next floor, for no extra battery cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296022
    m_Localized: Fuse Map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296023
    m_Localized: Fuses, buttons, vaults and keys glow faintly. The compass points at them too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296024
    m_Localized: WARM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296025
    m_Localized: COLD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296026
    m_Localized: EMBER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296027
    m_Localized: VIOLET
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296028
    m_Localized: BONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296029
    m_Localized: PHOSPHOR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296030
    m_Localized: AMBER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296031
    m_Localized: ICE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296032
    m_Localized: THE WARD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296033
    m_Localized: BOILER DECK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296034
    m_Localized: THE CRYPT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296035
    m_Localized: THE LAB
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296036
    m_Localized: THE HOLLOW
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296037
    m_Localized: DYING GRID
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296038
    m_Localized: A lamp loses power every minute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296039
    m_Localized: KEEN EARS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296040
    m_Localized: It hears farther here. Shards are worth more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296041
    m_Localized: HEAVY FOG
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296042
    m_Localized: You see less; so does it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296043
    m_Localized: WEAK BATTERY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296044
    m_Localized: You start half-charged, but it stores faster off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296045
    m_Localized: RESTLESS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296046
    m_Localized: It moves and appears more often.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296047
    m_Localized: GLASS FLOORS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296048
    m_Localized: More broken glass and puddles underfoot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296049
    m_Localized: RICH VEINS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296050
    m_Localized: More shards, but it walks a little faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296051
    m_Localized: It hunts by sound here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296052
    m_Localized: It is fast here, but forgets quickly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296053
    m_Localized: '{name}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763065
  - m_Id: 375296054
    m_Localized: Never hide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296055
    m_Localized: Finish the floor without entering a locker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296056
    m_Localized: Not a scratch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296057
    m_Localized: Never get caught - and never let Stan touch you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296058
    m_Localized: Walk in the dark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296059
    m_Localized: Spend 60 seconds walking with your torch off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296060
    m_Localized: Take what glitters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296061
    m_Localized: Collect at least 60% of the shards on the floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296062
    m_Localized: Read it all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296063
    m_Localized: Read every note on the floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296064
    m_Localized: Don't dawdle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296065
    m_Localized: Clear the floor before the clock runs out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296066
    m_Localized: Make some noise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296067
    m_Localized: Make the hunter come and investigate a thrown bottle or can, twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296068
    m_Localized: Light feet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296069
    m_Localized: Never sprint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296070
    m_Localized: FLOOR {floor} CLEARED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763065
  - m_Id: 375296071
    m_Localized: STARS  {stars} x {value}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763065
  - m_Id: 375296072
    m_Localized: TIME LEFT  {time}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763065
  - m_Id: 375296073
    m_Localized: FLOOR {floor} CLEARED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763065
  - m_Id: 375296074
    m_Localized: SHARDS FOUND  {n} x {value}  (already yours)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763065
  - m_Id: 375296075
    m_Localized: CONSOLATION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375296076
    m_Localized: CONSOLATION  {percent}% of {stars} {stars:plural:star|stars}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763065
  - m_Id: 74059196829696
    m_Localized: It will not let you leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 397341183873024
    m_Localized: Floor Plan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 397341263564800
    m_Localized: 'Rare. Hold {key} on the floor that needs it: the map shows only where you have walked.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4707331672703763065
  - m_Id: 1866634939068416
    m_Localized: Dynamo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982976
    m_Localized: The torch recharges much faster while it is off, on the next floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982977
    m_Localized: Archivist's Lamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982978
    m_Localized: Notes and patient files glow faintly on the next floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982979
    m_Localized: Stethoscope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982980
    m_Localized: The hunter's footsteps carry clearly through walls on the next floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982981
    m_Localized: BONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982982
    m_Localized: WARD GREEN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982983
    m_Localized: OATH RED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982984
    m_Localized: Unseen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982985
    m_Localized: Never be chased.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982986
    m_Localized: Hands to yourself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982987
    m_Localized: Throw nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982988
    m_Localized: Cut it close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1866635001982989
    m_Localized: Reach the way out with 20 seconds or less to spare.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
